  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A wider umbrella for women and children protection in Sudan: leaving no one behind</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&#x2019;s rights in conflict with the law are promoted and protected and an all-inclusive efficient response to GBV is established. 

Outcome 1: To enhance the response to gender-based violence through providing effective and inclusive services. 
Outcome 2: to enhance the wellbeing and protection of children at IDP Camps from abuse, and GBV. 
Outcome 3: To Support the promotion and protection of women human rights inside detention.</narrative>
  </description>
